{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The SSD fits my interest in improving my computer setup; I would consider it as a storage upgrade after checking SATA compatibility.",
    "The wired headphones fit desk listening, connecting with my earlier headphone purchases and recent under-desk headphone holder."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The Alexa speakers, display, smart bulb and plug assume I want home automation, but my purchases have been solving specific computer and desk needs.",
    "An HDMI cable does not mean I need a streaming stick, and Ethernet accessories do not mean I want a monitoring camera; neither addresses a task I currently have."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "The suggestions treat interest in electronics as a reason to want many unrelated electronic devices.",
    "My cables and Raspberry Pi purchases seem to have been read as interest in connected home entertainment, overlooking what I was using those accessories to accomplish."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My recent Ethernet adapter, patch cables, computer duster and headphone holder point toward maintaining and organizing a practical computer workspace.",
    "Compatibility and a clear use matter to me: a possible storage upgrade or wired desk listening gives me a reason to choose something, while another smart device does not."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The suggestions partly recognized my computer and audio interests but stretched them into home automation and streaming needs I do not currently have."
}"}
